  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186087699,
      "id": "9b9ef325-2358-5041-8a8d-b459e8ed9f09",
      "title": "Determining the Inverse of a 2x2 Matrix"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "b6add772-b3fa-5f88-9bde-78b5a413de87",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the matrices\n$A = \\begin{bmatrix}2 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -3\\end{bmatrix}, B = \\begin{bmatrix}-3 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}, C = \\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{4} & \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{4} & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}$.\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\n1. $AB = BA = I_{2}$\n2. $AC = CA = I_{2}$\n3. $B = A^{-1}$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/worked-solution": "We must check whether each pair multiplies to $I_2$.\n\nComputing $AB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -4\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{4} & \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{4} & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing $CA$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CA & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{4} & \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{4} & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only\".",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "3bb5d20e-1e6d-5eef-aa32-1cd9752e1db9",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "771cb6dc-5048-5d06-aee3-1771195e806a",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "44529552-750b-5c0b-a2b8-c333fd4e457c",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "87b93ec2-ad30-541a-94fb-fc884124fa1d",
